%N A398519 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} Lambda(k)/(k*(k+1)), where Lambda = log(A014963) is the Mangoldt function.
%C A398519 This constant appears in the asymptotic formula for A398518.
%H A398519 Olivier Bordellès, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1142/S1793042122501056">On certain sums of number theory</a>, International Journal of Number Theory, Vol. 18, No. 9  (2022), pp. 2053-2074; <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.05751v2">arXiv preprint</a>, arXiv:2009.05751 [math.NT], 2020.
