%H A398519 Kui Liu, Jie Wu, and Zhishan Yang, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.indag.2021.09.005">A variant of the prime number theorem</a>, Indagationes Mathematicae, Vol. 33, No. 2 (2022), pp. 388-396.
